# MCP server rules

- One persistent document/history per process.
- Tool changes need matching docs in `mcp-server/README.md` and ideally a golden scenario note in `docs/agent-mcp.md`.
- Return stable IDs usable by later tools; do not reshuffle IDs on no-op recomputes.
- Prefer additive tools; deprecate carefully with README notes.
- Native OCCT only for solid truth — no silent mesh approximations for CAD ops.
